WEBVTT

01:41.500 --> 01:45.960
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.670 --> 01:49.020
[Episode 9]

01:50.680 --> 01:52.400
One day when you find out the truth,

01:53.150 --> 01:54.000
will you still

01:54.000 --> 01:55.000
part ways with me

01:57.000 --> 01:58.350
and never ever see me again

01:59.759 --> 02:00.710
as you said?

02:10.400 --> 02:11.750
I still have another signature dish!

02:11.800 --> 02:12.370
Just wait and see!

02:12.390 --> 02:12.870
Just a moment!

02:14.000 --> 02:14.960
There are enough dishes!

02:20.630 --> 02:21.870
Master

02:23.190 --> 02:25.079
seems so lonely.

02:31.590 --> 02:32.150
Where are you going?

02:33.760 --> 02:34.510
I want to ask Master

02:34.530 --> 02:35.530
if he'd like to join us.

02:35.630 --> 02:36.400
How nice it'll be

02:36.430 --> 02:37.750
if everyone's having fun together.

02:40.030 --> 02:41.270
Given Guardian's severe injuries,

02:41.310 --> 02:42.150
there's barely time for recovery.

02:42.550 --> 02:43.670
How could he be in the mood for festivities?

02:43.960 --> 02:44.630
Is Master

02:45.120 --> 02:46.150
seriously injured?

02:47.170 --> 02:48.000
It's all your fault.

02:48.530 --> 02:49.650
Every time bringing you to the mountain,

02:49.740 --> 02:51.060
Guardian ends up with a few more wounds.

02:51.740 --> 02:52.900
Come on, time to grow up.

03:16.680 --> 03:17.430
Master,

03:17.850 --> 03:18.680
are you alright?

03:24.250 --> 03:25.220
Sorry, Master.

03:26.250 --> 03:27.020
I've caused you

03:27.040 --> 03:28.420
too much trouble before.

03:28.780 --> 03:30.030
And I even got you injured.

03:32.210 --> 03:33.420
I really failed as your disciple.

03:50.740 --> 03:51.380
Master,

03:51.780 --> 03:53.130
this is Red-flame Centipede's blood,

03:53.290 --> 03:54.200
a panacea for wounds.

03:54.490 --> 03:55.380
Drink it while it's still hot.

03:55.540 --> 03:56.450
It'll taste fishy if it cools down.

03:56.890 --> 03:57.820
Just some minor wounds.

03:58.420 --> 03:59.329
I don't need this.

03:59.930 --> 04:01.260
I saw you coughing up blood!

04:01.540 --> 04:02.490
No way those are just minor wounds!

04:05.300 --> 04:06.260
I'm an orphan.

04:06.860 --> 04:08.300
I've seen the cold and warm sides of human nature since young.

04:09.050 --> 04:10.650
Even if someone gives me a bowl of porridge,

04:10.890 --> 04:12.170
it's just out of sympathy.

04:12.930 --> 04:13.820
No one has ever

04:13.890 --> 04:15.170
been as good to me as you.

04:15.930 --> 04:17.140
You're the first person in the world

04:17.380 --> 04:18.140
who didn't hesitate

04:18.170 --> 04:19.399
to stand up and protect me.

04:24.090 --> 04:25.210
I wasn't willing to become

04:25.970 --> 04:27.580
your disciple back then.

04:28.850 --> 04:29.410
But from now on,

04:29.770 --> 04:31.290
I will strictly follow your teachings

04:31.650 --> 04:32.620
and never let you get hurt

04:32.620 --> 04:33.450
because of me again, Master.

04:37.500 --> 04:38.330
Actually,

04:39.210 --> 04:40.290
I planned to use

04:40.290 --> 04:41.330
this bowl of centipede blood

04:41.650 --> 04:43.409
to make up for the missing tea ceremony to pay my respects to my master.

04:44.620 --> 04:46.090
Since you don't like it,

04:46.740 --> 04:47.650
I'll...

05:01.920 --> 05:03.220
Master, how do you feel?

05:03.500 --> 05:04.290
Do you feel any better?

05:06.620 --> 05:07.530
That's great!

05:08.050 --> 05:08.850
Then I'll take my leave now.

05:17.660 --> 05:19.770
♫If the full moon is destined to wane♫

05:20.010 --> 05:22.780
♫If time is bound to change everything♫

05:23.150 --> 05:27.340
♫Then I wish to follow you like a migrating bird♫

05:27.540 --> 05:30.840
♫Never tired of gazing at you, longing for you day and night♫

05:30.870 --> 05:34.050
♫I wish to be with you forever♫

05:31.620 --> 05:32.970
Having taken the tonic,

05:33.180 --> 05:34.140
Master's probably fully recovered,

05:34.080 --> 05:38.460
♫Braving every trial and tribulation♫

05:34.140 --> 05:35.090
back and resting in his room.

05:38.480 --> 05:43.810
♫A red thread weaves our fates together♫

05:44.180 --> 05:49.500
♫Every loop and circle is filled with my longing for you♫

05:49.980 --> 05:51.620
Why am I feeling so restless and hot?

05:50.030 --> 05:53.070
♫Waiting for a fleeting rendezvous for thousands of years♫

05:53.200 --> 05:56.250
♫Like in a dream♫

05:55.930 --> 05:56.930
Red-flame Centipede.

05:56.270 --> 06:00.750
♫So we promised to hold hands tightly♫

05:57.409 --> 05:58.890
Its blood works miracles in healing.

05:59.350 --> 06:00.740
Besides, it can also boost yang energy

06:00.770 --> 06:01.860
and stir up lust.

06:00.890 --> 06:05.990
♫A circle of fate weaves love♫

06:02.450 --> 06:03.260
It's commonly used

06:03.850 --> 06:04.650
to replenish yang energy.

06:06.350 --> 06:11.400
♫All the sparkles mark my past years♫

06:06.650 --> 06:07.580
Xue Ranran...

06:08.820 --> 06:10.970
Master has saved me from danger several times.

06:11.500 --> 06:12.700
How else can I do

06:12.250 --> 06:15.120
♫With love, I fear no winds or storms♫

06:12.700 --> 06:13.970
to repay him properly?

06:15.140 --> 06:18.390
♫Through all these fleeting years♫

06:19.350 --> 06:25.400
♫You're the best thing that's ever happened to me♫

06:20.590 --> 06:22.120
It's indeed not easy to be a master.

06:23.740 --> 06:25.210
I shouldn't have given in

06:25.630 --> 06:26.990
and drunk that centipede blood.

06:42.409 --> 06:42.970
Yu Chen!

06:43.650 --> 06:44.260
Master.

06:47.940 --> 06:48.820
What's this all about?

06:50.280 --> 06:51.450
It's damp and cold on the mountain at night.

06:51.650 --> 06:52.500
I made a quilt for you, Master,

06:52.500 --> 06:53.770
to keep you warm.

06:54.290 --> 06:55.330
Back in the village,

06:55.409 --> 06:56.090
I often helped people

06:56.090 --> 06:57.030
with sewing and mending.

06:57.290 --> 06:58.180
I'm pretty adept at it.

06:58.740 --> 06:59.670
As a cultivator,

06:59.760 --> 07:00.760
how could the cold bother me?

07:01.430 --> 07:02.380
I didn't bring you here

07:02.380 --> 07:03.530
to do chores for others.

07:04.580 --> 07:05.500
I just wanted to

07:05.500 --> 07:06.620
repay you properly, Master.

07:08.020 --> 07:08.940
I embroidered

07:09.450 --> 07:10.830
these flowers

07:11.180 --> 07:12.060
stitch by stitch.

07:21.290 --> 07:21.970
Where are my books?

07:23.890 --> 07:24.890
I found those old books

07:24.890 --> 07:25.850
all damp and wet,

07:26.020 --> 07:27.290
so I took them outside to dry in the sun.

07:28.260 --> 07:28.850
You dried them?

07:39.650 --> 07:40.580
What's happening?

07:40.940 --> 07:42.420
Why are these characters fleeing away?

07:44.180 --> 07:45.060
The immortal's secret texts

07:45.060 --> 07:46.409
are all written with dark-cloud ink.

07:46.820 --> 07:47.500
Once exposed to the sun,

07:47.500 --> 07:48.740
it'll float away like feathers.

07:50.570 --> 07:51.650
No one else has ever taken them out to dry.

07:51.670 --> 07:52.310
You're the first one to do this.

07:53.770 --> 07:54.940
What should we do now?

07:56.210 --> 07:56.970
There's only one way.

07:57.600 --> 07:58.380
Put these characters

07:58.380 --> 07:59.260
back together one by one.

07:59.350 --> 08:00.410
No meals for you until it's done.

08:02.180 --> 08:02.820
Can't believe it.

08:05.580 --> 08:06.650
But there are so many characters

08:06.650 --> 08:07.940
that I don't even recognize.

08:23.580 --> 08:24.530
Where on earth

08:24.530 --> 08:26.260
should I put this talisman?

08:44.020 --> 08:45.140
It doesn't seem right no matter where I put it.

08:45.740 --> 08:47.500
Did you escape from his books

08:47.620 --> 08:48.690
to mess around?

08:59.530 --> 09:00.650
Finally nailed it.

09:02.020 --> 09:03.100
Thank you for your help, Master.

09:18.980 --> 09:20.620
Master only told me to put them back

09:21.290 --> 09:22.600
without any other requirements.

09:46.340 --> 09:46.890
Master,

09:47.410 --> 09:48.170
it's done.

09:52.670 --> 09:54.610
[Master, the Best in the World]

10:22.660 --> 10:25.340
[Training Field, Mount Wester]

10:27.170 --> 10:27.980
Trial passed.

10:28.830 --> 10:29.560
Thank you, Master.

10:38.980 --> 10:39.770
Trial passed.

10:40.980 --> 10:41.950
Thank you, Master.

10:44.690 --> 10:46.340
That demon tree is indeed formidable.

10:47.140 --> 10:48.350
Xi'er, are you alright?

10:49.410 --> 10:50.140
That was so scary.

10:50.490 --> 10:51.730
I almost end up as a pile of bones in the forest.

10:53.980 --> 10:54.530
Where's Ranran?

10:54.810 --> 10:55.570
She hasn't come out yet?

11:05.530 --> 11:06.260
Ranran!

11:09.980 --> 11:11.020
Did I pass?

11:13.490 --> 11:14.180
Great!

11:14.380 --> 11:15.320
Thankfully, I made it in time.

11:16.750 --> 11:17.550
I'll give you credit for improving.

11:21.690 --> 11:22.170
Ranran,

11:22.370 --> 11:23.340
your bag is broken.

11:28.500 --> 11:29.650
Fortunately, the pouch I got back

11:29.650 --> 11:30.380
from Master is not lost.

11:30.530 --> 11:31.770
Your pouch is so exquisite.

11:32.490 --> 11:33.500
I received this from Mr. Yu,

11:33.500 --> 11:34.050
a good friend

11:34.250 --> 11:35.130
of mine.

11:35.160 --> 11:35.890
He's a nice person.

11:36.380 --> 11:37.600
If we have a chance to go down the mountain,

11:37.930 --> 11:38.940
I'll introduce him to everyone.

11:39.530 --> 11:40.170
Look at your

11:40.170 --> 11:41.380
radiant face.

11:41.530 --> 11:42.500
Are you in love with him?

11:54.110 --> 11:54.780
Master...

12:03.100 --> 12:03.930
For alchemy,

12:03.610 --> 12:06.920
[Alchemy Hall, West Mountain]

12:04.910 --> 12:07.030
it's not just about controlling the herb properties

12:07.650 --> 12:08.580
and the heat,

12:09.380 --> 12:10.530
what's more important is

12:10.810 --> 12:11.860
developing one's inner self.

12:13.860 --> 12:14.810
Even the same pill's function

12:14.860 --> 12:16.090
may vary greatly

12:16.340 --> 12:17.860
depending on the maker.

12:18.410 --> 12:19.340
Your Grandmaster

12:19.620 --> 12:20.860
used to be a genius in alchemy.

12:21.340 --> 12:22.340
The pills she made

12:22.740 --> 12:23.860
not only boasted

12:23.930 --> 12:25.050
maximum medicinal functions

12:25.650 --> 12:26.570
but also had

12:26.570 --> 12:27.690
some unexpected properties.

12:34.380 --> 12:34.860
Ranran,

12:35.260 --> 12:36.290
your spiritual energy has finally stabilized.

12:41.530 --> 12:42.100
Not bad.

12:42.930 --> 12:43.500
Continue.

13:05.860 --> 13:07.220
According to the book,

13:07.570 --> 13:09.620
the Sanity Pill should be golden.

13:10.890 --> 13:12.620
How did you make red ones?

13:13.320 --> 13:15.030
Did I make any mistakes?

13:19.620 --> 13:20.650
Smells so good!

13:21.020 --> 13:22.290
There's a savory aroma.

13:28.340 --> 13:29.980
It tastes like buns stuffed with soup!

13:31.180 --> 13:32.160
It's Ranran's first try.

13:32.220 --> 13:33.020
I must give it a shot.

13:33.470 --> 13:34.170
Xi...

13:37.100 --> 13:38.530
It's delicious, Ranran!

13:40.650 --> 13:41.570
Enjoy them yourselves.

13:41.770 --> 13:42.640
I'm sitting this one out.

13:50.340 --> 13:51.140
Master!

13:51.170 --> 13:51.980
Master!

13:52.290 --> 13:53.020
Master,

13:53.170 --> 13:53.890
bad news!

13:54.650 --> 13:55.460
Something's wrong!

14:02.450 --> 14:02.980
Xi'er!

14:03.260 --> 14:05.340
Stop eating! You'll get sick from it!

14:05.890 --> 14:07.340
Stop eating, both of you.

14:08.500 --> 14:09.140
Master!

14:10.340 --> 14:10.890
Are you alright?

14:11.010 --> 14:11.650
I'm fine.

14:11.980 --> 14:13.380
Please save Senior Baishan and Xi'er.

14:14.770 --> 14:15.290
Don't eat it!

14:15.380 --> 14:16.050
That's raw meat.

14:16.930 --> 14:18.250
You'll get a stomachache.

14:18.930 --> 14:19.500
Xi'er!

14:19.730 --> 14:20.420
Don't eat it!

14:20.570 --> 14:21.340
Stop!

14:27.170 --> 14:28.220
What's going on here?

14:29.340 --> 14:30.850
I don't know either.

14:32.050 --> 14:32.890
They ate

14:33.170 --> 14:34.340
the Sanity Pills I made

14:34.690 --> 14:35.890
and then ended up like this.

14:46.570 --> 14:47.170
What were you thinking

14:47.170 --> 14:47.970
while making the pills?

14:56.530 --> 14:57.260
Your thoughts

14:57.260 --> 14:58.500
even affected the function of the Sanity Pills.

14:59.050 --> 15:00.260
You were really so into it.

15:00.530 --> 15:01.930
Although I don't force you to restrain yourself,

15:02.450 --> 15:03.690
you are still a cultivator after all.

15:04.020 --> 15:05.500
It's improper to be obsessed with food and drink

15:05.650 --> 15:06.260
all day long,

15:13.650 --> 15:14.740
How are you doing?

15:15.530 --> 15:16.570
Are you feeling any better?

15:17.380 --> 15:18.340
It's okay, Ranran.

15:18.860 --> 15:19.810
Master said we

15:19.810 --> 15:21.110
just had an eating disorder.

15:21.690 --> 15:23.500
We'll be fine after taking the medicine.

15:29.650 --> 15:30.170
Ranran,

15:30.980 --> 15:32.980
the Sanity Pills you put so much effort into

15:33.170 --> 15:34.650
had a really strong aftereffect.

15:35.650 --> 15:36.620
Seems like you do have

15:36.620 --> 15:38.260
some talent for alchemy

15:40.020 --> 15:41.530
despite

15:41.890 --> 15:43.380
the unexpected functions.

15:45.020 --> 15:46.860
Talent for alchemy?

15:47.500 --> 15:49.650
I'd say it's more like a talent for causing trouble.

15:51.050 --> 15:52.740
I'm sorry for frightening everyone this time.

15:53.290 --> 15:54.260
I've made a jar

15:54.260 --> 15:55.690
of grape and coix seed wine to help digestion

15:56.170 --> 15:57.100
and make up for you.

16:07.380 --> 16:09.410
-It smells so good, Ranran.
-It smells so good, Ranran.

16:16.140 --> 16:18.050
When it comes to culinary pleasures,

16:18.170 --> 16:19.570
you truly carry out our Grandmaster's

16:19.570 --> 16:20.530
sect motto,

16:22.140 --> 16:24.050
"Delicacies are worthy of delving into!"

16:26.650 --> 16:27.770
Do you think that's a compliment?

16:28.260 --> 16:29.650
Even good wine can't stop you from talking nonsense.

16:29.890 --> 16:30.570
Just shut up.

17:09.050 --> 17:09.770
Come on...

17:10.849 --> 17:12.089
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

17:17.920 --> 17:19.140
I worked so hard to prepare the food,

17:19.160 --> 17:20.310
yet you haven't even taken a bite!

17:21.460 --> 17:22.420
And there's so much wine left!

17:23.260 --> 17:24.260
Guys...

17:25.980 --> 17:26.829
I'll send some to Mr. Zeng

17:26.849 --> 17:27.500
and the others.

17:27.530 --> 17:28.089
-Okay.
-Okay.

17:38.750 --> 17:39.380
Master?

17:47.850 --> 17:48.850
What's inside?

17:51.010 --> 17:51.960
It's the food and wine

17:51.980 --> 17:52.900
for Mr. Zeng

17:52.900 --> 17:53.740
and Ms. Yu Tong,

17:56.220 --> 17:56.980
Leave it here.

17:57.740 --> 17:58.810
No way.

17:59.160 --> 18:00.100
The pills I made

18:00.180 --> 18:01.660
even caused Master to break his fast?

18:02.530 --> 18:04.360
Didn't expect my Sanity Pills

18:04.500 --> 18:05.260
to cause that trouble.

18:05.900 --> 18:06.530
I'm so sorry.

18:08.050 --> 18:08.740
It's alright.

18:09.850 --> 18:10.610
Breaking a fast

18:10.840 --> 18:11.460
is not really

18:11.460 --> 18:12.290
a big deal.

18:14.850 --> 18:15.660
You can tell a lot about

18:15.660 --> 18:16.610
a pill's maker from the way it works.

18:17.330 --> 18:18.090
You were never really

18:18.090 --> 18:19.180
a person detached from desires.

18:19.830 --> 18:21.630
You've always loved the worldly pleasures.

18:22.900 --> 18:24.130
Come to think of it, it's not surprising.

18:24.850 --> 18:25.460
Don't just stand there.

18:25.790 --> 18:26.590
Sit down and eat with me.

18:27.660 --> 18:28.130
Okay!

18:30.090 --> 18:30.660
Master,

18:30.900 --> 18:32.250
these butterfly shrimp are the best.

18:50.900 --> 18:51.570
Why aren't you drinking?

18:53.530 --> 18:54.750
Actually, I already

18:54.770 --> 18:56.050
had a few sips.

19:01.420 --> 19:02.090
Master.

19:04.660 --> 19:06.130
Let me tell you a secret.

19:07.570 --> 19:09.220
Every time I drink too much,

19:09.740 --> 19:11.050
the plants I touch

19:11.180 --> 19:12.420
grow wildly all of a sudden

19:12.530 --> 19:13.570
to be even taller than houses.

19:16.420 --> 19:17.260
When I was

19:17.340 --> 19:18.260
back in the village,

19:18.260 --> 19:19.350
I scared my friends with it.

19:20.330 --> 19:20.980
Since then,

19:21.330 --> 19:22.530
no matter how good the wine is,

19:23.130 --> 19:24.420
I don't dare to drink too much

19:25.570 --> 19:27.530
as I want to avoid similar weird incidents.

19:33.530 --> 19:34.050
Fill it up.

19:46.020 --> 19:46.610
I'm here with you.

19:47.130 --> 19:47.810
There's no weird incident

19:47.810 --> 19:48.770
that I can't handle.

19:52.330 --> 19:52.940
Just drink as you please.

20:02.530 --> 20:03.420
It's so good!

20:06.740 --> 20:08.180
Would you like to try some, Master?

20:08.700 --> 20:09.940
I may not be good at other stuff,

20:10.220 --> 20:11.500
but I'm quite confident

20:11.530 --> 20:12.850
in my wine-making skills.

20:17.700 --> 20:18.260
No, thanks.

20:19.290 --> 20:20.410
It just occurred to me that

20:20.810 --> 20:22.180
you can't hold your liquor.

20:22.940 --> 20:23.880
In that case,

20:24.700 --> 20:25.900
it's all mine now.

20:27.980 --> 20:28.850
No one's fighting you for it.

20:45.420 --> 20:45.980
Master,

20:46.500 --> 20:47.090
I'm not scared.

20:48.500 --> 20:49.740
Even if you're turned

20:49.980 --> 20:51.530
into a monster by the curse,

20:52.260 --> 20:53.260
I wouldn't be scared.

20:53.810 --> 20:54.770
Because I know,

20:55.180 --> 20:55.810
Master,

20:56.140 --> 20:57.980
you are still you.

21:13.530 --> 21:14.740
Master, you once asked me

21:15.690 --> 21:16.700
what I was thinking

21:16.700 --> 21:17.770
while making the pills.

21:18.570 --> 21:19.130
I was thinking

21:19.700 --> 21:20.460
if only I could remove

21:20.460 --> 21:21.940
the curse on your face.

21:25.770 --> 21:27.340
I know I'm not that capable now.

21:28.260 --> 21:28.930
But one day

21:29.430 --> 21:30.660
when I have enough spiritual power,

21:31.250 --> 21:32.200
I will definitely make a pill

21:32.220 --> 21:33.700
that can break the curse on your face.

21:54.370 --> 21:55.020
Master,

21:56.370 --> 21:58.020
I've always had a question.

21:58.850 --> 22:00.740
I'm cultivating for Ling Xiao.

22:01.570 --> 22:02.260
But

22:02.500 --> 22:03.330
given your

22:03.330 --> 22:04.290
overwhelming power,

22:04.530 --> 22:06.030
you still practice diligently every day.

22:06.500 --> 22:07.570
What is it for?

22:11.460 --> 22:12.330
Because of a person.

22:14.290 --> 22:15.740
I made some mistakes in the past.

22:17.420 --> 22:18.770
I want to make amends for these wrongdoings.

22:21.420 --> 22:22.250
Then do you

22:22.480 --> 22:23.930
hate that person who made you

22:24.700 --> 22:25.570
do the wrong things?

22:31.420 --> 22:32.830
Without my permission,

22:34.290 --> 22:35.860
she took the fall for me on her own.

22:42.290 --> 22:42.940
Of course,

22:44.220 --> 22:45.330
I hate her.

22:51.770 --> 22:52.760
But why

22:53.780 --> 22:55.340
do I see a trace of sorrow

22:55.370 --> 22:56.650
in your eyes?

22:58.740 --> 22:59.420
Nonsense.

23:00.700 --> 23:01.740
Xi'er said

23:02.260 --> 23:03.370
you always have

23:03.680 --> 23:04.920
a certain tension

23:04.940 --> 23:06.570
like a tightly strung string.

23:08.610 --> 23:10.050
People who are too tense

23:10.080 --> 23:10.940
can get exhausted easily.

23:12.180 --> 23:13.200
Why don't you try a bite

23:13.220 --> 23:14.370
of the sweet and sour yam I made

23:14.660 --> 23:15.290
for some sweetness

23:15.460 --> 23:16.330
and smile a little?

23:23.740 --> 23:24.570
From now on,

23:25.020 --> 23:26.220
we'll only taste sweetness, not bitterness.

23:28.020 --> 23:28.700
Shui,

23:30.480 --> 23:32.480
stay with me at Mount Wester from now on

23:33.330 --> 23:34.770
and enjoy a lifetime of happiness.

23:58.500 --> 23:59.470
Master...

24:02.610 --> 24:03.900
Your face...

24:05.220 --> 24:06.700
The curse on you is dissipating.

24:35.220 --> 24:36.770
Ranran helped me break the curse?

24:41.180 --> 24:42.050
Little junior!

24:43.940 --> 24:44.610
Ranran!

24:46.600 --> 24:47.400
My little junior!

24:47.430 --> 24:48.230
Xue Ranran!

24:48.530 --> 24:49.220
Where is she?

24:52.050 --> 24:52.740
Where are you?

24:52.900 --> 24:53.700
Xue Ranran!

24:53.940 --> 24:54.700
Ranran!

24:55.660 --> 24:56.050
Ran...

24:58.050 --> 24:58.810
How did the flowers on the tree

24:58.810 --> 24:59.810
grow all the way there?

25:00.900 --> 25:01.460
Never mind.

25:01.700 --> 25:02.370
Let's find Ranran first,

25:02.750 --> 25:03.810
lest she causes trouble again

25:03.980 --> 25:04.770
and drags us into it.

25:05.290 --> 25:06.020
Xue Ranran!

25:06.020 --> 25:06.610
Ranran!

25:06.900 --> 25:07.980
-Ranran!
-Ranran!

25:13.290 --> 25:14.050
Master,

25:15.460 --> 25:17.090
I think they've left.

25:18.740 --> 25:19.530
Did you

25:21.430 --> 25:25.890
♫After parting, the black silk-like hair turned snow-white♫

25:22.310 --> 25:23.420
recall anything?

25:25.610 --> 25:26.850
Recall what?

25:26.540 --> 25:31.660
♫In secret, I've been missing you, dreaming about you for years♫

25:30.810 --> 25:33.500
I've always said Master has the features of beauty,

25:31.740 --> 25:36.820
♫Awaiting the destined love, a déjà vu so real♫

25:34.290 --> 25:35.940
and would surely be exceptionally handsome.

25:37.060 --> 25:44.100
♫I'd trade three lifetimes of grandeur for your one fleeting bliss♫

25:37.740 --> 25:38.940
I just didn't expect

25:39.610 --> 25:40.700
you to be so stunningly gorgeous.

25:42.850 --> 25:43.530
You're drunk.

25:45.540 --> 25:49.960
♫Gradually gravitate toward you by love♫

25:46.770 --> 25:47.740
Master, look!

25:50.770 --> 25:55.850
♫Words are too weak to tell the whole story♫

25:55.290 --> 25:55.810
Oh, no.

25:55.880 --> 26:00.670
♫Only after I met you♫

25:56.740 --> 25:57.500
Master,

25:57.810 --> 25:59.430
I think I'm losing control.

26:00.990 --> 26:08.800
♫Did I realize there are heaven-like places all because of you♫

26:08.220 --> 26:10.850
I think I'm really drunk.

26:09.020 --> 26:13.660
♫Just because I'm destined to reunite with you again♫

26:12.530 --> 26:13.330
Master...

26:14.390 --> 26:18.940
♫Intertwined fates throughout reincarnation♫

26:14.480 --> 26:15.720
You're so nice.

26:19.770 --> 26:24.690
♫With endless time to write our story♫

26:24.720 --> 26:25.460
You're wrong

26:25.010 --> 26:28.930
♫We fulfill the vow forged through many lifetimes♫

26:26.910 --> 26:27.820
I'm not a good person

26:29.370 --> 26:34.420
♫From now onwards♫

26:30.460 --> 26:31.700
Once you recall everything,

26:35.370 --> 26:36.260
you won't forgive me.

26:41.640 --> 26:44.670
[Su Yishui's Consciousness]

26:45.460 --> 26:46.770
Where am I?

26:47.850 --> 26:49.290
How did I end up here?

26:55.180 --> 26:56.050
Who's there?

26:56.770 --> 26:57.370
Ranran?

26:58.660 --> 27:00.260
Why is she in my consciousness?

27:13.420 --> 27:14.550
Oh, so he's your soul owner.

27:14.810 --> 27:16.020
And I'm in his consciousness.

27:16.250 --> 27:17.850
Could it be that my cultivation worked,

27:18.160 --> 27:19.800
and I opened up the connection between you?

27:23.130 --> 27:23.900
Who is he?

27:24.090 --> 27:24.940
Do I know him?

27:27.500 --> 27:28.330
You don't remember?

27:31.810 --> 27:33.570
Why is he trapped in this icy prison

27:34.180 --> 27:35.460
as if he's encaging himself?

27:39.330 --> 27:40.420
Can you hear me?

27:40.980 --> 27:42.370
Your spiritual soul is here!

27:42.570 --> 27:43.050
Look!

27:51.290 --> 27:51.980
I'm not sure

27:52.130 --> 27:53.610
if you can hear me speaking.

27:54.220 --> 27:55.570
But I still want to say thank you.

27:55.930 --> 27:57.670
Thank you for sending your spiritual soul to protect me.

27:58.420 --> 27:59.940
I will definitely protect Ling Xiao well.

28:00.260 --> 28:00.980
One day,

28:01.180 --> 28:01.770
I will surely

28:01.770 --> 28:02.940
return it to you safe and intact.

28:03.610 --> 28:04.330
At that time,

28:04.570 --> 28:06.090
I'll thank you properly in person.

28:13.910 --> 28:14.600
Why

28:14.970 --> 28:16.800
does he look as lonely as Master?

28:22.370 --> 28:23.660
Although it's our first meeting,

28:24.180 --> 28:25.610
I feel quite familiar with you.

28:26.050 --> 28:27.460
We must have some sort of fate.

28:28.700 --> 28:29.460
Are you

28:30.020 --> 28:30.810
my dad?

28:36.130 --> 28:36.610
Fine.

28:37.520 --> 28:38.720
I don't know why

28:38.740 --> 28:39.330
you're trapping yourself

28:39.330 --> 28:40.750
in this icy wilderness.

28:41.210 --> 28:42.260
You must be very bored.

28:42.770 --> 28:44.500
How about I stick around and talk with you for a bit?

28:46.260 --> 28:47.370
I have a secret

28:47.850 --> 28:48.980
that I can't keep to myself anymore.

28:49.850 --> 28:50.740
I must tell someone.

28:51.090 --> 28:52.130
I'll share it with you secretly.

28:52.810 --> 28:54.700
My master is so handsome.

28:54.870 --> 28:55.880
He's the most

28:55.900 --> 28:57.180
handsome man in the world.

28:58.330 --> 28:59.090
But I wouldn't dare

28:59.420 --> 29:00.810
say these words to him.

29:01.220 --> 29:02.220
I can only tell you.

29:05.940 --> 29:08.420
My master's eyes are so bright

29:08.900 --> 29:10.610
like stars in the highest sky.

29:14.940 --> 29:16.570
Master's nose is high and straight,

29:16.940 --> 29:18.260
like a steep mountain peak,

29:18.700 --> 29:20.020
majestic and towering,

29:20.570 --> 29:22.090
making his profile look fabulous.

29:27.940 --> 29:28.740
As good-looking

29:29.130 --> 29:30.980
as he is, I wonder what kind of woman

29:31.420 --> 29:32.200
in the world

29:32.450 --> 29:34.260
could be a match for him.

29:54.260 --> 29:55.020
Ling Xiao, Ling Xiao.

29:56.610 --> 29:57.660
Did I really enter

29:57.900 --> 29:59.020
your consciousness just now?

29:59.570 --> 30:00.500
I was not dreaming?

30:04.000 --> 30:05.800
Master said cultivation could nourish Ling Xiao.

30:06.700 --> 30:07.850
Could it be that my spiritual power

30:08.050 --> 30:09.090
has improved a bit recently,

30:09.260 --> 30:10.530
awakening your spiritual consciousness?

30:12.850 --> 30:14.290
Master didn't lie to me!

30:16.020 --> 30:16.660
Master?

30:17.530 --> 30:18.050
Oh, no!

30:19.020 --> 30:20.130
I actually got blotto

30:20.130 --> 30:20.860
in front of Master

30:21.480 --> 30:22.310
and even conjured vines

30:22.330 --> 30:23.370
to trap him!

30:25.500 --> 30:26.610
What now?

30:27.900 --> 30:28.660
Su Yishui!

30:35.160 --> 30:35.960
It's not what you think.

30:36.370 --> 30:37.130
No more excuses.

30:38.660 --> 30:39.850
You said you kept Master

30:39.850 --> 30:41.420
at Mount Wester to cure her.

30:42.130 --> 30:43.740
I think you're clearly up to something else!

30:45.050 --> 30:46.620
You just want to take advantage of her amnesia

30:47.050 --> 30:48.090
to make her rely on you.

30:48.530 --> 30:49.610
So when Master recalls everything,

30:49.610 --> 30:50.810
she won't hold a grudge against you anymore, right?

30:51.980 --> 30:52.740
Do you think I have no idea

30:52.740 --> 30:54.050
about your feelings for Master in the past?

30:54.660 --> 30:55.290
You're simply

30:55.290 --> 30:56.530
taking advantage of her not knowing anything.

30:58.330 --> 30:58.940
You're overthinking it.

30:59.790 --> 31:00.900
I've already picked up the Unfeeling Mantra.

31:01.610 --> 31:02.410
I cannot fall in love,

31:02.770 --> 31:03.530
and nor will I.

31:04.100 --> 31:04.940
I don't believe you.

31:05.460 --> 31:06.410
You're just a maniac.

31:06.850 --> 31:08.360
You even dared to split your own core.

31:09.050 --> 31:10.180
Perhaps you'd rather endure

31:10.180 --> 31:11.420
the pain of the Ice Lotus Technique's backlash

31:11.610 --> 31:12.710
to get what you want.

31:14.330 --> 31:15.770
Even if the Ice Lotus's backlash can't stop me,

31:16.220 --> 31:17.290
do you think I would ignore

31:17.320 --> 31:18.040
Master's last wish?

31:21.600 --> 31:22.390
You mean

31:22.900 --> 31:23.610
sealing the Spirit Spring?

31:24.830 --> 31:25.770
This is what I owe her.

31:26.260 --> 31:27.020
I must pull it off.

31:28.310 --> 31:28.960
Sealing the Spirit Spring

31:28.980 --> 31:30.050
requires power at the Transcendence Realm.

31:30.570 --> 31:31.700
Indulging in love would cause the power to dissipate.

31:32.700 --> 31:33.570
So what you're worried about

31:33.570 --> 31:34.460
will never happen.

31:35.970 --> 31:37.090
Instead of keeping an eye on me,

31:37.420 --> 31:38.330
you'd better think more about

31:38.350 --> 31:39.350
how to break the Soul-Devouring Lock.

31:43.610 --> 31:44.130
Fine!

31:44.660 --> 31:45.900
I'll trust you one more time.

31:46.570 --> 31:47.940
But you must keep your word.

31:48.700 --> 31:49.770
And I'll be always watching you.

32:14.980 --> 32:15.980
Hope Master will forgive me

32:15.980 --> 32:16.850
for the sake

32:17.050 --> 32:17.940
of the delicious food

32:22.780 --> 32:23.340
Ranran.

32:24.530 --> 32:25.980
Where are you going with that food box?

32:26.460 --> 32:27.690
I'm going to deliver food to Master.

32:29.020 --> 32:30.460
Delivering food to Master?

32:31.500 --> 32:32.350
Ranran,

32:33.290 --> 32:34.420
are you still drunk?

32:34.770 --> 32:35.580
No, I'm not!

32:36.130 --> 32:37.770
Sink or swim, it all depends on this attempt.

32:50.020 --> 32:51.660
Ranran, you're amazing.

32:51.860 --> 32:53.330
You even made Master break her fast.

32:56.060 --> 32:57.630
I did more than that, actually.

32:57.980 --> 32:59.410
I even broke the curse on Master.

33:00.090 --> 33:01.180
The merits and faults balance out.

33:01.610 --> 33:02.090
Seems like

33:02.090 --> 33:03.570
Master not only won't punish me

33:03.900 --> 33:05.570
but might even reward me.

33:09.650 --> 33:10.260
Xue Ranran,

33:10.610 --> 33:11.810
the Guardian wants you to go to the Ice Lotus Pool.

33:28.250 --> 33:29.570
Mu Ranwu is about to be born.

33:29.650 --> 33:30.850
Must crack the Soul-Devouring Lock as soon as we can.

33:31.130 --> 33:32.490
The good thing is that Ranran's been working hard these days

33:32.850 --> 33:33.850
to stabilize her heart.

33:34.260 --> 33:35.020
No time to waste.

33:35.260 --> 33:36.020
Let's remove it right now.

33:36.200 --> 33:36.660
Okay.

34:02.800 --> 34:03.370
Oh, no!

34:05.590 --> 34:06.460
How could this happen?

34:07.310 --> 34:08.480
Her heart hasn't been fully fixed yet.

34:10.860 --> 34:12.130
We underestimated its power.

34:12.980 --> 34:14.480
This Soul-Devouring Lock is like a bottomless pit.

34:14.780 --> 34:15.860
No stable heart,

34:16.340 --> 34:17.340
no way to crack the Soul-Devouring Lock.

34:17.900 --> 34:18.730
If the Lock's not removed,

34:19.130 --> 34:19.980
the heart can't be stabilized.

34:20.780 --> 34:21.940
It's a dead end either way.

34:22.170 --> 34:22.570
Well...

34:22.909 --> 34:23.820
What should we do?

34:29.570 --> 34:30.690
We don't necessarily have to crack

34:30.690 --> 34:31.570
the Lock through Ranran.

34:31.880 --> 34:32.730
You mean

34:33.409 --> 34:34.780
we can find a solution through Mu Ranwu?

34:35.210 --> 34:36.570
Mu Ranwu is about to be born.

34:37.250 --> 34:38.409
Let's go to Mount Absolute together.

34:39.050 --> 34:39.940
Besides removing the Soul-Devouring Lock,

34:40.420 --> 34:40.900
I have also

34:40.900 --> 34:41.860
prepared a surprise for her.

34:42.500 --> 34:42.980
A surprise?

34:44.940 --> 34:45.730
18 years ago,

34:46.340 --> 34:47.170
she had already planned

34:47.250 --> 34:48.460
to steal Mu Qingge's spiritual power.

34:48.860 --> 34:49.460
On the Reincarnation Tree,

34:49.460 --> 34:50.780
she didn't leave Mu Qingge any chance to survive.

34:51.100 --> 34:51.760
You still

34:51.780 --> 34:52.860
can't see through her ambition?

34:53.050 --> 34:54.340
She wants to become Mu Qingge.

34:57.940 --> 34:59.050
Why don't we fulfill her wish

34:59.270 --> 35:00.570
and let her have this identity?

35:01.340 --> 35:02.020
Does she think being Mu Qingge

35:02.020 --> 35:02.940
is really that easy?

35:03.670 --> 35:05.280
Hope she doesn't regret it too quickly.

35:06.210 --> 35:07.020
Speaking of which,

35:07.650 --> 35:08.250
before Master passed away,

35:08.250 --> 35:09.820
her biggest worry was the Spirit Spring.

35:10.370 --> 35:11.050
So she asked you

35:11.050 --> 35:12.170
to seal it back in the netherworld.

35:12.870 --> 35:14.050
Although before your seclusion,

35:14.080 --> 35:14.610
you set up

35:14.650 --> 35:15.690
many talismans in the mortal world

35:15.690 --> 35:16.500
to monitor the Spirit Spring,

35:17.170 --> 35:17.730
the Yin Eye Stone

35:17.730 --> 35:19.020
still hasn't shown any response.

35:19.690 --> 35:20.570
The whereabouts of the Spirit Spring

35:20.700 --> 35:21.530
still remain unknown.

35:22.420 --> 35:23.130
Since we have

35:23.130 --> 35:24.130
no clues,

35:24.730 --> 35:26.050
maybe we should get help from others.

35:27.210 --> 35:27.940
I've got other plans

35:28.380 --> 35:29.340
for this trip up the mountain.

35:40.730 --> 35:41.340
Go.

35:41.610 --> 35:42.210
-Yet.
-Yes.

35:50.900 --> 35:51.530
Elder Tu,

35:51.940 --> 35:52.780
what are you doing?

35:53.390 --> 35:54.040
My Lord,

35:54.250 --> 35:54.980
I'm sending them to sneak into

35:54.980 --> 35:55.860
the Heavenly Sects to investigate

35:56.020 --> 35:56.860
and ease your concerns.

35:58.460 --> 35:59.250
Elder Tu,

35:59.650 --> 36:01.210
you do have half of the Scarlet Sect Token,

36:01.900 --> 36:02.610
but that doesn't mean

36:02.940 --> 36:03.610
you can call the shots

36:03.610 --> 36:04.820
without my permission.

36:05.090 --> 36:05.570
Remember,

36:06.050 --> 36:07.050
I am the sovereign.

36:07.900 --> 36:09.130
Don't abuse your power

36:09.530 --> 36:10.820
or meddle in things beyond your responsibilities.

36:11.170 --> 36:12.650
I just wanted to make proper arrangements

36:12.940 --> 36:13.940
before reporting to you, My Lord.

36:15.050 --> 36:15.690
Don't bother.

36:17.170 --> 36:18.610
Another fruit is about to fall.

36:19.170 --> 36:20.610
That is our main target.

36:21.250 --> 36:22.460
I've already got a plan.

36:23.570 --> 36:24.380
As for you,

36:25.170 --> 36:26.860
you just need to follow my orders.

36:27.900 --> 36:28.780
Yes, My Lord.

36:31.330 --> 36:32.090
When the time comes,

36:32.450 --> 36:33.860
I'll go up the mountain to try them first.

36:34.440 --> 36:35.630
You lead our men and wait at the foot of the mountain,

36:36.250 --> 36:37.210
awaiting my signal.

36:39.170 --> 36:39.650
Yes, My Lord.

36:42.610 --> 36:44.860
The Reincarnation Fruit is about to come into being.

36:45.380 --> 36:45.980
Your Highness,

36:46.340 --> 36:48.300
you'll get what you wish for soon enough.

36:51.350 --> 36:52.980
It's a pity that Ranran's missing.

36:53.750 --> 36:55.150
Otherwise, I could bring Qingge's

36:55.170 --> 36:56.050
favorite wine

36:56.890 --> 36:57.570
to meet her.

36:59.500 --> 36:59.980
Your Highness,

37:00.690 --> 37:01.980
this is an urgent letter from the capital.

37:04.980 --> 37:08.480
[His Majesty's condition has worsened. The Third Prince contacted the major ministers to impeach the Crown Prince. Dark clouds are gathering over the capital.]

37:04.980 --> 37:08.480
[Your Highness]

37:07.800 --> 37:08.430
Your Highness,

37:08.900 --> 37:09.900
did anything happen in the palace?

37:11.690 --> 37:13.250
It's about my third brother and his men again.

37:15.800 --> 37:17.150
Do they think teaming up with the imperial court's elders

37:17.170 --> 37:17.860
can make a difference?

37:18.690 --> 37:19.530
You've governed the state well.

37:19.840 --> 37:21.190
The Third Prince's allies, like Minister Li

37:21.210 --> 37:21.780
and Vice Minister Huang,

37:21.960 --> 37:22.880
put in so much effort

37:22.900 --> 37:23.460
and played the tricks

37:23.500 --> 37:24.530
all for nothing.

37:25.040 --> 37:25.630
Do they still have

37:25.650 --> 37:26.780
other schemes or plots?

37:29.500 --> 37:30.900
Father's old illness has worsened.

37:31.900 --> 37:33.230
I couldn't serve him medicine

37:33.250 --> 37:34.130
by his side.

37:35.090 --> 37:36.860
They're using this to make a fuss.

37:38.020 --> 37:38.980
According to the reports from the palace,

37:39.140 --> 37:40.340
His Majesty's condition this time

37:40.340 --> 37:41.250
is indeed quite serious.

37:41.280 --> 37:41.760
If...

37:47.130 --> 37:48.500
If things go wrong...

37:48.940 --> 37:50.420
Your Highness, you'd better return to the capital immediately.

37:56.270 --> 37:57.880
Of all times, why now?

37:59.210 --> 38:00.130
State affairs are the top priority.

38:00.940 --> 38:02.880
Your Highness, you should return to the capital as soon as possible.

38:03.170 --> 38:03.900
There's no time to waste.

38:08.340 --> 38:08.940
Not sure

38:09.460 --> 38:10.570
if that Wei Jiu from the Scarlet Sect

38:11.250 --> 38:13.090
was sent by the Third Prince.

38:13.820 --> 38:14.500
Please let us

38:15.250 --> 38:17.570
escort you back.

38:17.820 --> 38:18.690
That'd be safe.

38:22.460 --> 38:23.020
Never mind.

38:23.940 --> 38:25.460
I'll go to pick her up once I wrap up things

38:27.460 --> 38:28.530
in the palace.

38:30.690 --> 38:32.050
The Guardian has gone down the mountain on business.

38:32.490 --> 38:33.780
Today, you will train on your own.

38:34.090 --> 38:35.050
If you have any questions,

38:35.130 --> 38:35.860
come to ask me.

38:36.650 --> 38:37.860
Yes, Madam.

38:42.170 --> 38:42.980
Heed my command.

38:46.130 --> 38:46.690
Take cover from the rain.

38:55.900 --> 38:57.170
Master has gone down the mountain.

38:57.600 --> 38:59.210
Could it be that Grandmaster's really going to be reborn?

39:00.660 --> 39:01.590
What Grandmaster?

39:04.730 --> 39:05.900
Nowadays, the Heavenly Sects

39:06.170 --> 39:07.340
as well as the demonic cultivators of the Scarlet Sect

39:07.900 --> 39:09.460
are all searching for the Spirit Spring.

39:10.940 --> 39:12.250
We Westers

39:11.360 --> 39:14.610
[Work Hard]

39:12.300 --> 39:13.900
better stay away

39:13.900 --> 39:14.730
from Mu Qingge,

39:15.170 --> 39:16.300
that demoness.

39:22.780 --> 39:23.860
They all say that Grandmaster...

39:25.250 --> 39:26.140
Mu Qingge.

39:27.250 --> 39:28.250
She summoned the Spirit Spring

39:28.500 --> 39:31.190
and almost caused devastation to all living beings in the world.

39:31.940 --> 39:33.650
But what exactly is this Spirit Spring?

39:33.680 --> 39:35.360
Why does it have such destructive power?

39:37.530 --> 39:39.050
You don't even know that?

39:45.530 --> 39:46.530
The Spirit Spring

39:48.020 --> 39:49.610
is the spiritual sense and power

39:50.170 --> 39:53.570
of the primordial Mortal-Demon Lord.

39:51.090 --> 39:54.580
[Celestial Sect, Mount Red Flame]

39:55.050 --> 39:55.940
Hundreds of years ago,

39:56.250 --> 39:58.090
the Immortal Realm launched an all-out attack on the Mortal-Demon Lord.

39:59.020 --> 40:00.420
The Mortal-Demon Lord fled with severe injuries

40:00.690 --> 40:01.780
and hid in the mortal world.

40:02.080 --> 40:03.050
At Mount Red Flame,

40:03.080 --> 40:04.540
he established the Celestial Sect,

40:05.500 --> 40:07.380
Greetings, Sovereign.

40:08.050 --> 40:10.170
leading to the chaos and war clouds caused by a large number of

40:08.320 --> 40:09.520
[Mortal-Demon Lord]

40:10.690 --> 40:11.730
frenetic demonic cultivators,

40:12.460 --> 40:13.090
Fortunately,

40:13.500 --> 40:14.940
a once-in-a-century talent

40:14.970 --> 40:17.130
for immortal cultivation, Dun Tian, showed up

40:17.250 --> 40:17.940
in our mortal realm,

40:18.250 --> 40:19.860
who also

40:19.860 --> 40:20.690
founded the Eternal Sect.

40:21.020 --> 40:22.570
Dun Tian led the Heavenly cultivators

40:23.050 --> 40:24.050
to ambush at Mount Red Flame,

40:24.460 --> 40:25.730
destroy the Celestial Sect,

40:25.900 --> 40:27.090
and slay the Mortal-Demon Lord.

40:27.340 --> 40:28.340
That's also how he attained ascension.

40:29.240 --> 40:30.880
But the Mortal-Demon Lord's spiritual sense and power

40:31.300 --> 40:32.210
could not be busted.

40:32.860 --> 40:34.250
The immortals could only join forces

40:34.250 --> 40:35.460
to seal it in the netherworld.

40:36.170 --> 40:36.780
And this

40:37.650 --> 40:39.130
is the Spirit Spring.

40:42.460 --> 40:43.690
Only Mu Qingge

40:43.720 --> 40:44.890
could summon

40:45.300 --> 40:47.090
the Spirit Spring as the Demon's child

40:48.130 --> 40:49.900
and maximize

40:50.420 --> 40:51.500
its demonic power.

40:53.710 --> 40:54.960
No wonder the Four Heavenly Sects

40:54.980 --> 40:55.820
are so wary of her.

40:57.020 --> 40:57.530
That's right.

40:58.210 --> 41:00.110
If Mu Qingge is reborn,

41:00.340 --> 41:02.020
she will definitely seek revenge on Master.

41:02.860 --> 41:04.590
Will she then extend her hatred

41:04.610 --> 41:05.380
to us as well?

41:07.050 --> 41:08.820
Look at your timidity!

41:10.090 --> 41:11.090
As the saying goes,

41:11.900 --> 41:12.980
evil can never triumph over good.

41:14.610 --> 41:16.110
How could the Heavenly Sects just stand by and see

41:16.130 --> 41:17.500
that demoness, Mu Qingge,

41:17.690 --> 41:18.940
kill the innocent at will?

41:19.820 --> 41:20.530
If you're scared,

41:20.690 --> 41:21.460
it's still not too late

41:21.660 --> 41:23.790
for you to leave the mountain and be a coward.

41:24.900 --> 41:25.980
Is that Mu Qingge

41:26.380 --> 41:28.130
really such a terrifying demoness?

41:29.340 --> 41:30.520
[Library of the Wester Sect]

41:31.730 --> 41:33.210
So many ancient texts abound.

41:33.570 --> 41:35.210
How long will it take to go through them all?

41:47.420 --> 41:49.020
Spiritual Soul Separation.

41:51.460 --> 41:52.300
Found it.

41:54.500 --> 41:55.820
After being separated, a spiritual soul

41:56.090 --> 41:58.020
still retains fragmented memories of the soul owner.

41:58.530 --> 42:00.570
During the separation,

42:00.650 --> 42:02.050
the memories will gradually fade away.

42:02.340 --> 42:03.680
The shorter the separation, the clearer the memories.

42:03.860 --> 42:06.090
When the separated soul's power is strong enough,

42:06.120 --> 42:07.810
those whose consciousness is connected to it

42:07.940 --> 42:09.300
can glimpse the memories.

42:11.380 --> 42:12.130
All in all,

42:12.570 --> 42:13.860
I still need to step up my cultivation.

42:14.210 --> 42:15.690
to help Ling Xiao nourish his soul power.

42:16.340 --> 42:17.900
Only then will I have a chance to uncover

42:18.190 --> 42:19.090
some memories related to

42:19.090 --> 42:20.020
Ling Xiao's soul owner.

42:24.300 --> 42:24.900
Cultivate!

42:50.410 --> 42:51.500
Collection of Entertainment...

42:52.380 --> 42:53.410
It's Grandmaster's handwriting.

42:58.520 --> 43:02.520
[Vast sea of knowledge]

43:16.730 --> 43:17.820
Isn't this Master?
